  "description": "There was always a huge rivalry between Voodoo Child and his younger brother. Ever since he was young, Jake played with different liquids in order to produce interesting effects. However, he had trouble concentrating due to the incessant noise of his brother’s music, which caused Jake to have some explosive accidents. When Voodoo Child joined forces with Coal Cauldron, Jake chose another path. The latter’s cruelty had always bothered Jake. After some years of perfecting his recipes, he created Nitro Grog: a cocktail that would explode when subjected to shock. Jake then joined forces with Blink’s band in order to reason with his brother and put an end to the tyranny of Coal Cauldron.",
